: 1000 ml\r\n\r\nColor: Green\r\n\r\nShape: Rectangular\r\n\r\nWeight: 250 g\r\n\r\nLid Type: Secure snap-lock lid\r\n\r\nMicrowave Safe: Yes (without lid)\r\n\r\nDishwasher Safe: Yes\r\n\r\nFreezer Safe: Yes\r\n\r\nReusable: Yes\r\n\r\nPrice: $20.99", "cover_image": "media/foodcontainer.png", "category": 7, "tag": [2, 3, 5]}}, {"model": "product.product", "pk": 4, "fields": {"created_at": "2026-09-27T08:15:45.744Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T08:17:02.383Z", "title": "Notebook", "price": 0.99, "rating": 5, "description": "A stylish and practical notebook designed for everyday writing, studying, planning, and note-taking. It features high-quality paper and a durable cover, making it suitable for students, professionals, and anyone who likes to keep their ideas organized.", "is_available": false, "is_added": false, "information": "Material: Premium paper and hardcover\r\nSize: A5\r\nPages: 60 pages\r\nPaper Color: White\r\nCover Color: Black\r\nBinding: Spiral binding\r\nPaper Type: Lined\r\nWeight: 350 g\r\nDimensions: 21  14.8 cm\r\nPrice: $0.99\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nSmooth, high-quality paper\r\nDurable hardcover\r\nEasy-to-carry A5 size\r\nSuitable for notes, sketches, and planning\r\nSpiral binding for easy page turning\r\nMinimal and professional design", "cover_image": "media/copybook.png", "category": null, "tag": [2, 3, 6, 7]}}, {"model": "product.productphoto", "pk": 1, "fields": {"created_at": "2026-09-26T20:30:00.208Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-26T20:30:00.208Z", "photo": "media/Pens_JZ41eZo.avif", "product_id": 1}}, {"model": "product.productphoto", "pk": 2, "fields": {"created_at": "2026-09-26T21:05:25.298Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-26T21:05:25.298Z", "photo": "media/highlighters_HvGwvur.jpeg", "product_id": 2}}, {"model": "product.productphoto", "pk": 3, "fields": {"created_at": "2026-09-27T06:31:24.520Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T06:31:24.520Z", "photo": "media/detailed__fc.png", "product_id": 3}}, {"model": "product.productphoto", "pk": 4, "fields": {